{"hierarchy":{"paths":[["doc:\/\/Flows\/documentation\/Flows","doc:\/\/Flows\/documentation\/Flows\/GraphProtocols","doc:\/\/Flows\/documentation\/Flows\/GraphProtocols\/DirectedGraph"]]},"primaryContentSections":[{"kind":"declarations","declarations":[{"tokens":[{"text":"func","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"minimumCostFlow","kind":"identifier"},{"text":"<","kind":"text"},{"text":"S","kind":"genericParameter"},{"text":", ","kind":"text"},{"text":"C","kind":"genericParameter"},{"text":", ","kind":"text"},{"text":"W","kind":"genericParameter"},{"text":">(","kind":"text"},{"text":"supply","kind":"externalParam"},{"text":": (","kind":"text"},{"text":"Self","kind":"typeIdentifier"},{"text":".","kind":"text"},{"text":"Vertex","preciseIdentifier":"s:14GraphProtocols08DirectedA0P6VertexQa","kind":"typeIdentifier","identifier":"doc:\/\/GraphProtocols\/documentation\/GraphProtocols\/DirectedGraph\/Vertex"},{"text":") -> ","kind":"text"},{"text":"S","kind":"typeIdentifier"},{"text":", ","kind":"text"},{"text":"capacity","kind":"externalParam"},{"text":": (","kind":"text"},{"text":"Self","kind":"typeIdentifier"},{"text":".","kind":"text"},{"text":"Edges","preciseIdentifier":"s:14GraphProtocols08DirectedA0P5EdgesQa","kind":"typeIdentifier","identifier":"doc:\/\/GraphProtocols\/documentation\/GraphProtocols\/DirectedGraph\/Edges-swift.associatedtype"},{"text":".","kind":"text"},{"text":"Index","preciseIdentifier":"s:Sl5IndexQa","kind":"typeIdentifier"},{"text":") -> ","kind":"text"},{"text":"C","kind":"typeIdentifier"},{"text":", ","kind":"text"},{"text":"cost","kind":"externalParam"},{"text":": (","kind":"text"},{"text":"Self","kind":"typeIdentifier"},{"text":".","kind":"text"},{"text":"Edges","preciseIdentifier":"s:14GraphProtocols08DirectedA0P5EdgesQa","kind":"typeIdentifier","identifier":"doc:\/\/GraphProtocols\/documentation\/GraphProtocols\/DirectedGraph\/Edges-swift.associatedtype"},{"text":".","kind":"text"},{"text":"Index","preciseIdentifier":"s:Sl5IndexQa","kind":"typeIdentifier"},{"text":") -> ","kind":"text"},{"text":"W","kind":"typeIdentifier"},{"text":") -> ","kind":"text"},{"text":"MinimumCostFlow","preciseIdentifier":"s:5Flows15MinimumCostFlowV","kind":"typeIdentifier","identifier":"doc:\/\/Flows\/documentation\/Flows\/MinimumCostFlow"},{"text":"<","kind":"text"},{"text":"Self","kind":"typeIdentifier"},{"text":", ","kind":"text"},{"text":"C","kind":"typeIdentifier"},{"text":", ","kind":"text"},{"text":"W","kind":"typeIdentifier"},{"text":">? ","kind":"text"},{"text":"where","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"S","kind":"typeIdentifier"},{"text":" : ","kind":"text"},{"text":"SignedInteger","preciseIdentifier":"s:SZ","kind":"typeIdentifier"},{"text":", ","kind":"text"},{"text":"C","kind":"typeIdentifier"},{"text":" : ","kind":"text"},{"text":"BinaryInteger","preciseIdentifier":"s:Sz","kind":"typeIdentifier"},{"text":", ","kind":"text"},{"text":"W","kind":"typeIdentifier"},{"text":" : ","kind":"text"},{"text":"SignedInteger","preciseIdentifier":"s:SZ","kind":"typeIdentifier"}],"languages":["swift"],"platforms":["Linux"]}]},{"content":[{"type":"heading","level":2,"text":"Discussion","anchor":"discussion"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"A positive supply is how much more the vertex sends than it receives; a negative one is a"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"demand. There is no flow when the supplies do not sum to zero or some set of vertices"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"supplies more than its out-edges carry. Costs may be negative, and negative cycles are"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"saturated. A self-loop carries its capacity when its cost is negative and nothing"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"otherwise. Capacities may be of an unsigned type, up to "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"Int.max"},{"type":"text","text":"."}]},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Computed by the network simplex with block-search pivots and strongly feasible trees."},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"Which optimum is returned when several exist is unspecified, but the same input always"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"gives the same result. "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"supply"},{"type":"text","text":" is called once per vertex in "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"vertices"},{"type":"text","text":" order, then, for"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"each edge in position order, "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"capacity"},{"type":"text","text":" and then "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"cost"},{"type":"text","text":", before any work."}]},{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Every capacity is at least zero; capacities, supplies and costs fit in"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"Int"},{"type":"text","text":"; Σ capacity × |cost| fits in "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"Cost"},{"type":"text","text":" (checked before solving, since it bounds the"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"total cost); 4(n + 1)(the greatest |cost| of a non-loop edge + 1) fits in "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"Int"},{"type":"text","text":" (the"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"solver’s artificial cost, with room for its potentials and reduced costs); the positive"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"supplies sum within "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"Int"},{"type":"text","text":" and "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"Capacity"},{"type":"text","text":"."}]}],"type":"aside","style":"note","name":"Precondition"}],"kind":"content"}],"abstract":[{"text":"A least-cost flow within capacities that meets every supply, or nil when there is none.","type":"text"}],"sections":[],"variants":[{"traits":[{"interfaceLanguage":"swift"}],"paths":["\/documentation\/flows\/graphprotocols\/directedgraph\/minimumcostflow(supply:capacity:cost:)"]}],"